<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Bing: site:*.mil "DCGS-A Capability Drop 1" offeror</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=site%3a*.mil+%22DCGS-A+Capability+Drop+1%22+offeror</link><description>Search results</description><image><url>http://www.bing.com:80/s/a/rsslogo.gif</url><title>site:*.mil "DCGS-A Capability Drop 1" offeror</title><link>http://www.bing.com:80/search?q=site%3a*.mil+%22DCGS-A+Capability+Drop+1%22+offeror</link></image><copyright>Copyright © 2026 Microsoft. All rights reserved. These XML results may not be used, reproduced or transmitted in any manner or for any purpose other than rendering Bing results within an RSS aggregator for your personal, non-commercial use. Any other use of these results requires express written permission from Microsoft Corporation. By accessing this web page or using these results in any manner whatsoever, you agree to be bound by the foregoing restrictions.</copyright><item><title>American Airlines Vacations - Use AAdvantage Miles</title><link>https://www.aavacations.com/use-aadvantage-miles</link><description>AAdvantage members can redeem as few as 1,000 miles to pay for the non-flight portion of any American Airlines vacation package - including hotel and resort stays, car rentals, transfers, tours and activities.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 16:34:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>AAdvantage® program overview - American Airlines</title><link>https://www.aa.com/i18n/aadvantage-program/overview.html</link><description>Earn and use AAdvantage® miles and Loyalty Points to elevate your travel experiences. Book now and unlock rewards on your way to status.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 16:56:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Use miles – AAdvantage® program – American Airlines</title><link>https://www.aa.com/web/i18n/aadvantage-program/use-miles/use-miles.html</link><description>You earned your AAdvantage® miles – now it's time for an unforgettable experience. Use miles to book a flight, find a hotel, rent a car or find a vacation package.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 17:10:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>AAdvantage® program - American Airlines Vacations</title><link>https://www.aavacations.com/aadvantage-program</link><description>When you travel, you'll earn miles to redeem on future travel and Loyalty Points toward AAdvantage® status and Loyalty Points Rewards. And once you reach AAdvantage® status, you can even earn more.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 15:44:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>American Airlines AAdvantage: Your ultimate guide - The Points Guy</title><link>https://thepointsguy.com/loyalty-programs/american-airlines-aadvantage/</link><description>Everything you need to know about the American Airlines AAdvantage program, including partners, elite status, earning miles, redeeming miles and Loyalty Points.</description><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 21:47:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>AAdvantage Cruises</title><link>https://www.aadvantagecruises.com/</link><description>Find the best cruise and vacation deals on the Internet, make cruise and hotel and reservations online, and research vacation destinations online at AAdvantage Cruises</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 17:03:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>American Airlines and Citi elevate premium travel with enhanced Citi ...</title><link>https://news.aa.com/news/news-details/2026/American-Airlines-and-Citi-elevate-premium-travel-with-enhanced-Citi-AAdvantage-Executive-World-Legend-Mastercard-AADV-08/default.aspx</link><description>American Airlines, Citi and Mastercard announced updates to the Citi ® / AAdvantage ® Executive World Legend Mastercard ®, offering new and enhanced premium travel and lifestyle benefits. The refreshed card delivers up to $2,300 in value, increased earning potential and faster path to AAdvantage ® status.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 17:10:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Log in help - AAdvantage® - American Airlines</title><link>https://login.aa.com/miniMenu?locale=en_US</link><description>Log in to your AAdvantage account to manage bookings, check-in, and access exclusive benefits with American Airlines.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 16:49:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>AAdvantage Hotels™ platform</title><link>https://www.aadvantagehotels.com/ah/home/en/</link><description>Discover and book accommodations with AAdvantage Hotels™ platform for a seamless travel experience.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 16:56:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Benefits of the Citi® / AAdvantage® Platinum Select® World Elite ...</title><link>https://www.citi.com/credit-cards/credit-card-miles/aadvantage-platinum-select-benefits</link><description>The Citi ® / AAdvantage ® Platinum Select ® Card offers a mix of everyday earning and travel benefits that can add value when you fly American Airlines. Whether you’re a business traveler or an adventure-seeker, you can benefit from these offers.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 16:49:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>